# Equinox's ability may target any spell (rulings): Game of Chaos destroys no land, so it is not countered. Working that out
# resolved Game of Chaos on a hidden copy of the game (CR 608.2) - flipping coins and asking whether to flip again - and
# none of it reached the game: no one is asked anything while the ability resolves, and the one coin the scenario fixes
# is still there for the real flip, which Bot2 wins.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Equinox
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Black Lotus
Game of Chaos
Mountain x12

[Dice]
1

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Equinox.Cast(Plains)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Game of Chaos.Cast(Bot1)
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate(Stack.Game of Chaos; Ability: Counter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot2.Accept
Bot2.Decline

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 21
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Graveyard = Game of Chaos; Black Lotus
